msgid "Amaranthus is a highly nutritious crop cultivated widely across Africa and Asia. However, it is susceptible to several diseases that reduce yield and quality. Early detection is critical to preventing crop loss and protecting farmer livelihoods."
msgstr "Mchicha ni zao lenye lishe nyingi linalolimwa sana Afrika na Asia. Hata hivyo, lina uwezekano wa magonjwa kadhaa yanayopunguza mavuno na ubora. Ugunduzaji wa mapema ni muhimu kuzuia upotezaji wa mazao na kulinda maisha ya wakulima."

msgid "This system uses a state of the art machine (deep) learning model trained on over 3,136 leaf images to classify Amaranthus leaf diseases with"
msgstr "Mfumo huu unatumia modeli ya kisasa ya kujifunza kwa kina iliyofunzwa kwa picha zaidi ya 3,136 za majani kuainisha magonjwa ya majani ya Mchicha kwa"

msgid "accuracy"
msgstr "usahihi"

msgid "Farmers can simply take a photo and receive instant, expert-level recommendations."
msgstr "Wakulima wanaweza tu kupiga picha na kupokea mapendekezo ya papo hapo ya kiwango cha kitaalamu."

msgid "Normal healthy Amaranthus leaf with no signs of disease or infection."
msgstr "Jani la Mchicha lenye afya bila dalili za ugonjwa au maambukizi."

msgid "Uniform green color"
msgstr "Rangi ya kijani sawa"

msgid "No spots or lesions"
msgstr "Hakuna madoa au majeraha"

msgid "Smooth leaf surface"
msgstr "Uso laini wa jani"

msgid "Fungal disease causing dark necrotic spots on leaf surfaces, reducing photosynthesis."
msgstr "Ugonjwa wa ukungu unaosababisha madoa meusi ya kifo kwenye uso wa jani, kupunguza usanisinuru."

msgid "Dark brown/black spots"
msgstr "Madoa ya kahawia giza/meusi"

msgid "Yellowing around spots"
msgstr "Njano inayozunguka madoa"

msgid "Leaf wilting"
msgstr "Kunyauka kwa jani"

msgid "Oomycete pathogen (Albugo bliti) causing white powdery pustules. Spreads rapidly."
msgstr "Vimelea vya Oomycete (Albugo bliti) vinavyosababisha vidonda vya unga mweupe. Huenea haraka."

msgid "White chalky patches"
msgstr "Mabaka meupe kama chaki"

msgid "Distorted leaves"
msgstr "Majani yaliyopotoka"

msgid "Premature leaf drop"
msgstr "Kuanguka kwa majani mapema"

msgid "Image does not contain an Amaranthus leaf — the model cannot provide reliable results."
msgstr "Picha haina jani la Mchicha — modeli haiwezi kutoa matokeo ya kuaminika."

msgid "Wrong plant species"
msgstr "Aina mbaya ya mmea"

msgid "Unclear/blurry photo"
msgstr "Picha isiyo wazi/iliyofifia"

msgid "Non-leaf objects"
msgstr "Vitu visivyo majani"

msgid "Compact yet powerful CNN architecture. Achieves 94%+ accuracy with only 5.3M parameters — perfect for fast inference."
msgstr "Usanifu wa CNN mdogo lakini wenye nguvu. Hufikia usahihi wa zaidi ya 94% kwa vigezo 5.3M tu — kamili kwa uelekezaji wa haraka."

msgid "Optimized model format for production deployment. Runs inference in milliseconds without GPU requirements."
msgstr "Umbizo la modeli liliboreshwa kwa utekelezaji wa uzalishaji. Huendesha uelekezaji kwa millisekunde bila mahitaji ya GPU."

msgid "Robust Python web framework handling image uploads, model inference, database storage, and recommendations."
msgstr "Mfumo thabiti wa wavuti wa Python unaoshughulikia upakiaji wa picha, uelekezaji wa modeli, hifadhi ya hifadhidata, na mapendekezo."

msgid "Take a Clear Photo"
msgstr "Piga Picha Wazi"

msgid "Photograph an Amaranthus leaf in good lighting. Fill the frame with the leaf."
msgstr "Piga picha ya jani la Mchicha katika mwanga mzuri. Jaza fremu na jani."

msgid "Upload the Image"
msgstr "Pakia Picha"

msgid "Go to the Detect Disease page and drag & drop or browse to select your image (JPG/PNG, max 10MB)."
msgstr "Nenda kwenye ukurasa wa Gundua Ugonjwa na buruta na achia au vinjari ili kuchagua picha yako (JPG/PNG, upeo wa 10MB)."

msgid "Wait for Analysis"
msgstr "Subiri Uchambuzi"

msgid "The AI model will process your image in under 2 seconds."
msgstr "Modeli ya AI itashughulikia picha yako kwa chini ya sekunde 2."

msgid "Read the Results"
msgstr "Soma Matokeo"

msgid "Review the predicted disease, confidence score, risk level, and full recommendation with treatment options."
msgstr "Kagua ugonjwa uliobashiriwa, alama ya uhakika, kiwango cha hatari, na mapendekezo kamili na chaguzi za matibabu."

msgid "This system was developed as an academic research project aimed at supporting smallholder Amaranthus farmers through artificial intelligence. The model was trained on a carefully curated dataset of 3,136 annotated leaf images using transfer learning with EfficientNet B0."
msgstr "Mfumo huu ulitengenezwa kama mradi wa utafiti wa kitaaluma unaolenga kusaidia wakulima wadogo wadogo wa Mchicha kupitia akili bandia. Modeli ilifunzwa kwenye seti ya data iliyochaguliwa kwa makini ya picha 3,136 za majani zilizopigwa alama kwa kutumia kujifunza kwa uhamishaji na EfficientNet B0."

